- **Land:** the previous land came back red only because its build never ran. I recommitted the same change on current main as d56e81e: cloud's nightly build at 06:00 UTC, its plan-test assertion, and the README and STATE.md lines. Its land has been queued with the manager since 22:22Z, with no verdict yet. If my time runs out, the manager still lands it afterwards and posts the result on the issue.
- **Build of cloud from the pin:** my verification build (pipeline 3047054112) started from `build.lock`, so this is not a "no pin" failure. It still returned "no verdict within 3h", even though Jody's runner change (a9ae65e, the shared pool takes build jobs only) was committed 17 minutes earlier. The cause is tacplus-dev/looper#113: the build jobs are stuck waiting for a free slot on the only runner that takes them. I can't tell whether a9ae65e wasn't applied yet or isn't enough. That pipeline is not visible to me (404) and I have no GitLab credential.
